WEBVTT

00:00.240 --> 00:01.640
Elder brother misunderstands

00:02.360 --> 00:03.760
I brought this

00:03.880 --> 00:04.680
Because General Zu

00:04.760 --> 00:06.640
Has long fought against the Wutu

00:06.720 --> 00:08.800
Knows best the structure of Wutu riding equipment

00:08.880 --> 00:10.200
I came to seek the general's advice

00:10.280 --> 00:11.947
On how to improve it

00:17.240 --> 00:18.000
The court

00:18.160 --> 00:19.280
Is willing to consider

00:19.360 --> 00:20.760
The border garrison troops

00:21.240 --> 00:21.920
This is

00:22.000 --> 00:23.080
The state's fortune

00:23.160 --> 00:24.800
And my fortune as well

00:24.880 --> 00:26.280
I remember

00:26.400 --> 00:28.440
Last year the court discussed going north

00:28.520 --> 00:29.560
But because the treasury was empty

00:29.640 --> 00:30.760
No money, no grain

00:30.840 --> 00:31.040
In the end

00:31.120 --> 00:32.280
It came to nothing

00:32.360 --> 00:34.027
Looking at it this way

00:34.120 --> 00:36.120
From last year to this year

00:37.000 --> 00:37.560
Elder brother has

00:37.640 --> 00:38.880
Been managing the household well

00:39.040 --> 00:41.160
The general rarely returns to the capital

00:41.240 --> 00:43.240
Even if I treat myself poorly

00:43.760 --> 00:44.640
I cannot treat poorly

00:44.720 --> 00:46.387
The pillars of the state

00:47.360 --> 00:48.560
Your Highness overpraises

00:48.640 --> 00:50.400
You humble your subject too much

00:50.480 --> 00:51.160
I also ask

00:51.280 --> 00:53.640
Prince of Jin to be cautious with words

00:53.720 --> 00:54.760
The inner hall is about to begin the banquet

00:54.880 --> 00:55.520
Prince of Jin

00:55.640 --> 00:56.560
Prince of Ning

00:56.640 --> 00:57.440
Please

00:57.520 --> 00:58.840
Please
